    <h2>An Emerging FMCG Company with a Long-Term Vision</h2>
    <p>Zuppio was founded with the ambition of building more than a snack brand. We are creating a diversified FMCG business focused on understanding evolving consumer needs and delivering products that improve everyday experiences.</p>
    <p>As we grow, our product portfolio will expand across multiple food and beverage categories, supported by strong distribution, innovative packaging, and customer-focused product development.</p>
  </div>

